TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite in hydrothermal solution at 100C - Custom rate

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

RATES
Calcite
-start
10  si_calcite = SI("Calcite")
20  IF (M <= 0 AND si_calcite < 0) THEN GOTO 200
30  rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2) * (1 - 10^si_calcite)
40  IF (rate < 0) THEN rate = 0
50  moles = rate * TIME
60  IF (moles > M) THEN moles = M
70  SAVE moles
200 END
-end

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  10.0   0.001
    -steps  1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic3.out
    -reset  false
    -time   true
    -pH     true
    -pe     true
    -si     Calcite

END
